{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117241","id":3371984732,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7I_Gdc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117241","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117241.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117241.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117241","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117241/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117241/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117241/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/105d4ee17c05bc9bb0e77bdfb0d9a7da49705063","number":117241,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Rewrite SSIL (which approximates global illumination using  screen space information)","user":{"login":"MopanionStudios","id":142198691,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHnHow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142198691?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios","html_url":"https://github.com/MopanionStudios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MopanionStudios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Rewritten SSIL logic\r\nAddresses [Improve SSIL/SSAO](https://github.com/orgs/godotengine/projects/33/views/1?pane=issue&itemId=75874346)\r\n\r\nThe current state of Godot's SSIL can be seen as quite far behind compared to current [state of the art implementations](https://www.shadertoy.com/view/XfcBDl), and so I have rewritten the current SSIL logic to remain performant, but with a more modern, up-to-date approach. I have discussed it quite a bit [in the rendering channel](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/rendering/thread/gpFmhr3ZxkvQ8yRad?jump=GdP0lSrmaBra0fXIw).\r\n\r\nThis approach uses visibility bitmasks, a relatively new method for screen space effects such as AO and GI, that keeps a far more accurate track of occlusion by storing visibility in a 32-bit \"bitmask\", with each bit representing that sector's visibility. This allows for far more appealing, accurate visuals at a relatively minimal added cost, and in the future can be easily shared between AO & GI since it is derived from [GTAO-VB](https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4cdfzf) logic. This technique has been pretty well documented and I will leave some references I used below.\r\n\r\nThe most prominent changes made are as such:\r\n\r\n\r\n* **Rewritten SSIL logic that closely matches [this](https://www.shadertoy.com/view/XfcBDl) Shadertoy's implementation**\r\n* **Rewritten, improved SSIL bilateral blur**\r\n* **Easy way for future implementation of GTAO-VB at little cost**\r\n\r\n# Showcase\r\n> ## Visuals\r\n>> ## No SSIL:\r\n>>https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42d1e511-27cb-4909-b554-a59c4c16c59c\r\n>> ## Current SSIL (medium, half-res enabled):\r\n>>https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48060760-5477-4ac0-9c87-b709608eaa3a\r\n>>## This PR's SSIL (medium, half-res enabled):\r\n>>https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/969d2694-b9d8-45dd-9302-987e77a2605c\r\n> ## Performance\r\n\r\n>>| **Current SSIL (medium, half-res enabled)** | **This PR's SSIL (medium, half-res enabled)** |\r\n>>|---|---|\r\n>>|0.45 ms|0.62 ms|\r\n\r\n# References/Inspiration\r\n> * [Screen Space Indirect Lighting with Visibility Bitmask: Improvement to GTAO/SSAO Real-Time Ambient Occlusion Algorithm](https://cybereality.com/screen-space-indirect-lighting-with-visibility-bitmask-improvement-to-gtao-ssao-real-time-ambient-occlusion-algorithm-glsl-shader-implementation/)\r\n> * [GT-VBGI (uniformly weighted)](https://www.shadertoy.com/view/XfcBDl)\r\n> * [[Godot Forest] SSILVB test, better LOD transitions and optimizations](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8v5MoWP-pzc)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/mileston